# DCIT 204 – Lab 2: Interactive Array Algorithms

## Student Information
- Name: Solomon Kwesi Arhinful
- Student ID: 22406063

---

## Programs Included

### 1. FindMax.java
This program:
- Accepts array size from the user
- Accepts array elements
- Finds the maximum value
- Displays the maximum value and its index

### 2. PairSum.java
This program:
- Accepts array size from the user
- Accepts array elements
- Accepts a target sum
- Uses a brute-force nested loop to find a pair
- Displays the matching indices and values

---

## Concepts Used
- Arrays
- Scanner class
- Loops
- Linear Search
- Nested Loops
- Brute Force Algorithm

---

## Time Complexity

### FindMax.java
- Time Complexity: O(n)

### PairSum.java
- Time Complexity: O(n²)

---

## How to Run

Compile:
```bash
javac FindMax.java
javac PairSum.java
````

Run:

```bash
java FindMax
java PairSum
```

